   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to cover the need for education in supervision of foster parents in Croatia, and is to be regarded as a final phasing out support for the activities in two years. The project  implementation will include theoretical- and job training in psychosocial work. The target groups in the project are; Social care providers, university teachers and advisors at the ministry of health</narrative>
